<title>USA: Spartan Motors raises special cash payout.</title>
<headline>Spartan Motors raises special cash payout.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLOTTE, Mich. 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spartan Motors Inc said Wednesday its board of directors increased the company's special cash dividend by 40 percent to $0.07 a share of common stock from $0.05.</p>
<p>Spartan, a custom chassis manufacturer, said the dividend is payable May 20 to shareholders of record on April 20.</p>
<p>Spartan Motors has paid a special cash dividend each of the past 10 years. The last increase was in 1992, it said.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
